        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kere kwayo rieko pa Isaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo kere Hezekia owinjo radwok pajo, oyeco nangin pere i rem to ruko kutiya, aka okidho i Ot pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ooro Eliakim m'oyido obedo jadwoŋ ma muluwir, Sebina jandiko ma kapido, gi jatuci wac Were m'otegino, to joruko kutiya, bongi Isaya wod pa Amoz. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a mikwenda m'omiyo jowaco ri Isaya ni, “Konon obedo ndelo ma kidamba, imiyo wan gir'acula aka wanitie i wickwot. Wacal dhako m'oyikere nywol, to meni loyo ma colo nyathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere ma Asiria ooro jadhum pere madwoŋ yeto Were makwo. Weyi Rwoth Were perin wowinji yet me, aka womiy joma joluwo gir'acula. Riameno kway ri ji mawan ma jodoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ŋecin pa kere Hezekia jobino bongi Isaya, Isaya owaco rijo ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Waci win ri jadwoŋ mewin ni, ‘Me apaka Rwoth waco. Ikir'ibwoki ro atise ma ŋecin pa kere jowaco rin ni Rwoth kinyal bothin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni, alaketho cuny i go, ŋey go wowinji pokopoko ma bino miyo go gik i piny pere won; aka alamiyo go wotho g'abor i piny pere won.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joasiria jodhiro atise man kendo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabisake to dok, aka onwaŋo ni kere ma Asiria oyido lwenyo gi tindi madwoŋ Libina, rupiri oyido otieko winjo ni kere oyido otieko ay Lakis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo kere ma Asiria owinjo ni kere Tirihaka ma Ethopiya oyido bino monjo jo, odhiro balwa ri kere Hezekia ma Yuda ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Me a gim'ila waco ri kere Hezekia ma Yuda. Ikir'iyey Were perin m'igeno wowondin ka cikin ni k'okethi Yerusalem i cingi kere ma Asiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni, itieko winjo gima kere ma Asiria otimo ri piny je m'oreyo jo kicutho. Iparo ni inokwale? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitie ye werin ma piny mogo m'otieko botho jo, piny ma kwarere paran joreyo woko, paka Gozan, Haran, Rezef, gi ji ma Eden m'oyido jonitie Telesar? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerin ma tindin madongo Hamath, Aripad, Sefarivayim, Hena, gi Iva jonikune?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwayo pa Hezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Hezekia ojolo balwa wok i cingi jomikwenda to soma. Kenyo okidho i Ot pa Rwoth to ketho balwa no ruwaŋ Rwoth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka okwayo ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 25:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Awi Rwoth pa lwak jolweny, Were pa Isiraili m'obedo i wi cwec ma jobwombi gin, in kende a Were, ma dhumo kerin je ma i piny. Icweyo polo gi piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Rwoth, winji wan aka neni gima timere riwan. Cik ithin iwinji gima Senakerib waco je ma yetin, Were makwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adieri Rwoth, kerin ma Asiria jotieko reyo piny kweth, to josika woko lowo pajo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jowaŋo woko werin pajo m'oyido jok'obedo werin kada to cal ma yen gi telin ma ji ama joyiko gi cingi jo, riameno orey woko jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno Rwoth Were mawan, akwayin, both wan kwoŋ Joasiria, ŋey nonin je ma piny jowoŋey ni in kende a Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mikwenda pa Isaya ri Kere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Isaya wod pa Amoz odhiro mikwenda ri kere Hezekia ni, Rwoth, Were pa Isiraili waco. Rupiri itieko kwayo t'awinjo kwayo perin ma mako kwoŋ Senakerib kere ma Asiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me wac ma Rwoth otieko luwo ma mako kwoŋ Senakerib.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Isaya owaco ri kere Hezekia ni, “Me ranyuth ma gima kidho timere. Oro me gi oro ma luwo ibino bedo gi ŋano madudi acama, to i oro mar'adek ibino nyalo cwoyo ŋano t'ikeco, aka ibino pidho yen vini t'icamo olemo mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ji ma joboth i Yuda jobino pidhirok pa yen ma jorwako fuc piny i lowo aka jonyak ranyak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole bino bedo ji ma jobino both i Yerusalem gi Got Zayon kwoŋbedo Rwoth omiyere miyo gime timirok.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno me a gima Rwoth owaco kwoŋ kere ma Asiria. Go kiladonjo i tindi madwoŋ me kosa celo asere kad'acel kwoŋe. Ongoye jolweny ma jonigi kwote ma jobino core cegin gi tindi madwoŋ, aka jok'othoki mako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bino gik gi royo acel m'obino gine, ma k'odonjo i tindi madwoŋ me. An Rwoth, atieko waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.34",
