              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole abino kikwonga tindi madwoŋ me t'abotho, ro an won gi cikirok m'atimo ri ŋeca paran Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.35",
