            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka wor no won malaika pa Rwoth okidho i kambi pa Joasiria to neko jolweny 185,000 aka munyo ji jocewi odikin joneno mulambin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
