        {
          "text": "Ndelo acel munyo go oyido lamo i ot pa were pere Nisrok, wote ario, Adramelek kodi Sareza joneko go g'abor pajo to joringo i piny Ararat. Aka wode man Esarhadon olunjo go paka kere.",
